{"unit_id":"stansz__dsh-convo-mode#card-zh","repo":"stansz/dsh-convo-mode","commit":"f1b9db7830717eb1de7e4590f15d16d74999fd68","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-convo-mode 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话对话模式插件。它在 profile bundle 中挂载 Host 与 Web 客户端部分，通过 /conversation 命令或输入框旁的 Chat 按钮切换状态，并将模式保存为会话投影。开启后，插件加入聊天式回复指导，并默认把当前 agent 的工具限制为配置的只读允许列表；用户也可配置提示内容、允许的工具、是否保留全部工具，以及新会话是否默认开启。命令支持直接附带消息进入模式，也支持 off 退出。适合希望在同一 DSH 会话中暂时切换到交谈方式、避免调用常规编码工具的用户。无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:266-302","index.js:366-384","index.js:397-417","index.js:501-547","client.js:152-180"]}
{"unit_id":"stansz__dsh-convo-mode#card-en","repo":"stansz/dsh-convo-mode","commit":"f1b9db7830717eb1de7e4590f15d16d74999fd68","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-convo-mode adds per-session chat mode to DSH Web. Toggle with /conversation or the composer chip; state persists per session. Active sessions get conversational guidance and a configurable read-only tool policy. /conversation <message> also sends text. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:266-302","index.js:366-384","index.js:397-417","index.js:501-547","client.js:152-180"]}
